Subject: [PATCH 024/110] Test code block colours in the Markdown preview

Moves building the editor's syntax system into a function, so tests can
build the same one.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/src/main.rs b/src/main.rs
